abilities_and_actions.description:
The mouther babbles incoherently while it doesn't have the Incapacitated condition. Saving Throw: wis DC 10, any creature that starts its turn within 20 feet of the mouther while it is babbling. Failure: The target rolls 1d8 to determine what it does during the current turn:

- {"entry": "The target does nothing.", "name": "1-4", "type": "item"}
- {"entry": "The target takes no action or {@variantrule Bonus Action|XPHB} and uses all its movement to move in a random direction.", "name": "5-6", "type": "item"}
- {"entry": "The target makes a melee attack against a randomly determined creature within its reach or does nothing if it can't make such an attack.", "name": "7-8", "type": "item"}

Saving Throw: wis DC 14, each creature in a 30-foot Cone. Failure: The target can't take Reactions until the start of the umber hulk's next turn, and the target rolls 1d8 to determine what it does on its next turn:

- {"entry": "The target does nothing.", "name": "1-4", "type": "item"}
- {"entry": "The target takes no action or {@variantrule Bonus Action|XPHB} and uses all its movement to move in a random direction.", "name": "5-6", "type": "item"}
- {"entry": "The target makes a melee attack against a random creature within its reach or does nothing if it can't make such an attack.", "name": "7-8", "type": "item"}
